contentText:
Madonna , Carole King , Jennifer Lopez and more stars are remembering Gloria Steinem following the death of the pioneering feminist, journalist and activist at age 92.

Steinem died Wednesday at her home in New York City, &#8220;surrounded by some of the many who loved her,&#8221; according to a statement shared on her official Instagram account. The statement said she continued working for equality until the end of her life.

